								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1663#msg1663">Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #15 on:</b> September 16, 2003, 03:44:34 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							As a true verzi member i think i would like to move verzi up a tad bit, i think we past Hegemony ..and UoP i dont know about but if not past, we next aside to em =)<br /><br />Could be me dreaming tho..i often do ...=)
