							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Forsaken and RoS are both very recently Elemental Flagged. Both I would assume had access to similar information.<br /><br />RoS has fewer members overall than Forsaken does to use in encounters on an average basis. At least from general guild roster size anyhow. They are now learning the elemental planes, and what they have to offer. The only thing that VT would give them that Elementals does not, is the speed of upgrades in a single night. VT can drop a large number of upgrades in a clearing, but it's a 7 day spawn. Elementals are a shorter spawn, but there's a ton of competition. Those two facts by themselves will slow both Forsaken and RoS down a bit in Elementals, since you have 4 other guilds already raiding there. Some more than others of course.<br /><br />And of course I'm full of it Gabus, I gotta take the WS all the time to make the Paladins look good &nbsp;:chair
