								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1697#msg1697">Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #24 on:</b> September 19, 2003, 08:27:32 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Ok, minor update as of last night.<br /><br />1) Ascent<br />2) EiE/DA<br />3-4) Arirang - FoT<br />5) Reign of Swords (Full Elemental Flagged with less)<br />6) Forsaken<br />7) Union of Power<br />8.) Hegemony<br />9) Spirit of Verzi<br />10) Century of Flame, Apotheosis, Menacing Visage<br />11) Dragon's Fist, Outcast Adventurers<br />12) Brew Masters<br />13) Exiled Knights<br />14) Tul Acharn? GC? AK? Adventurers Company <br /><br />At this time, and I while I can be yelled at for being biased, and if Arirang has advanced in another areas that I;m not aware of, please post it, Fires of Time is now for all intents and purposes even with Arirang kills list wise. Not quite farm wise, we need to down Fennin more as a Farm mob, and the Arbitor a time or two more. but overall, the kills list is even.
						</td>
					</tr>
