		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=65" title="View the profile of Breaenna ZaTeeva">Breaenna ZaTeeva</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 8<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Bite me!!!!!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=breaennazateeva"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=breaennazateeva&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="breaennazateeva" border="0" /></a>
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=65"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1731#msg1731"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/smiley.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1731#msg1731">Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #26 on:</b> September 22, 2003, 11:52:59 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&nbsp;;D<br /> &nbsp;Ok, hi all for one...<br /><br /> &nbsp; Next off, this top ten list. &nbsp;there seems to be a few small problems.<br /><br /> 1)Spirit of Verzi at #9? come on, Ive never heard of them. &nbsp;Either they are too stuck on themselves to sday &quot;hi&quot; to a lil dark elf like myself, OR, they dont exist...<br /><br /> b)You cant have more than one guild at any rank. &nbsp;No ties allowed...<br /><br />Thirdly)You have OA tied with DF at 11. &nbsp;Thats just wrong. &nbsp;I dont want to put my guild down but 11? come on.. &nbsp;13 is the best number in the world... &nbsp;Why cant we be 13? &nbsp;We prolly better than 13 but I like the number and OA is a good guild. &nbsp;Lotsa friends there.<br /><br /> Next up)I think AC should be ranked higher just cuz some of them say &quot;hi&quot; tome regularly.<br /><br />Last)Ive noticed Ascent has a few Paladins in their guild. &nbsp;That sure as hell is a downgrade cuz Paladins where that &quot;im all shiney and shit&quot; gear. &nbsp;So they should be pushed back until they realize that the dark side will overtake Norrath. And they cant stop me cuz they luv me...<br /><br /><br />ps. Thansk for letting DF be ranked. &nbsp;They have been the best friends/guild that I have ever seen in game. &nbsp;Always willing to help and always caring. &nbsp;They dont badmouth guilds that jump on the targets we are after, they dont badmouth anyone in game unless its me and ur a pally, and they actually believe RL comes before a stupid game. &nbsp;So after those few notes, I would like a recall. &nbsp;Clinton got one, can Dragons Fist?<br /><br /><br /><br />Baroness Breaenna ZaTeeva\<br /><br /><br />Im sure you all know me....
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Breaenna ZaTeeva<br />Shadow Knight<br />Dragons Fist
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
